    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used an AI tutor app to review calculus and algebra. It broke down complex topics into step-by-step explanations with examples I could relate to—like calculating football scores or garden dimensions. The interface was intuitive and helped me spot my mistakes. It didn’t replace my understanding, but it gave me confidence and made learning more engaging.",
